# Eidolon Simulacra Environment Configuration
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values
#
# The web app is local-first: drafts, templates, themes, and API keys live in the
# browser (or the desktop app data directory) and generation talks directly to the
# provider you configure in Settings. No API URL is read from the environment.
#
# There is no backend component, so the app reads nothing from this file today; it
# is kept only to document that and to hold any future local-only toggles.
